<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says wins Georgia GSM order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says wins Georgia GSM order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB said on Monday its Turkish subsidiary had received an order from  Turkcell to supply GSM exchanges and radio base stations to Georgia.</p>
<p>The equipment would serve 5,000 subscribers, Ericsson said in a statement. Delivery of the equipment would commence this autumn, Ericsson said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
